7
00:00:38.510 --> 00:00:41.530
Ma armastan

8
00:00:41.630 --> 00:00:44.559
Hullu pööra teatrit.

9
00:00:44.659 --> 00:00:46.934
Kas teiega?

10
00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:51.470
Suurepärane.

11
00:00:51.570 --> 00:00:53.900
Ma armastan

12
00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.470
Hullupööra muinasjutte.

13
00:00:57.570 --> 00:01:00.040
Kas Teie ka?

14
00:01:00.140 --> 00:01:04.930
No missuguseid muinasjutte teie
armastatu

15
00:01:05.030 --> 00:01:08.530
Loomadest huvitavad,
aga kas te seda muinasjutte teate

16
00:01:08.630 --> 00:01:13.160
