31
00:02:19.400 --> 00:02:22.990
Niisiis,
Meie muinasjututegelased on.

32
00:02:25.270 --> 00:02:27.795
Suurepärane kuningas.

33
00:02:31.639 --> 00:02:33.110
Hea.

34
00:02:33.210 --> 00:02:35.685
Ja armas printsess.

35
00:02:38.980 --> 00:02:42.310
Nutikas pillimees Jansi.

36
00:02:45.560 --> 00:02:50.510
Teiste muinasjututegelastega saate
