Kandis

44
00:03:21.440 --> 00:03:23.765
seal kuninga.

45
00:03:25.370 --> 00:03:26.920
Tere

46
00:03:27.020 --> 00:03:29.650
hoolitseb teri, armee

47
00:03:29.750 --> 00:03:31.210
kandis

48
00:03:31.310 --> 00:03:33.635
seal kuninga.

49
00:03:36.670 --> 00:03:39.570
Hoolitseb teel Järme.

50
00:03:39.670 --> 00:03:42.760
Keset lossi tort sestroo.

51
00:03:44.230 --> 00:03:48.250
Keset pea taga kullatud kro o.

52
00:03:50.470 --> 00:03:52.995
Ja kirjatud saab ana.

53
00:03:55.810 --> 00:03:59.850
Teada ta hiidusest aus.

54
00:03:59.950 --> 00:04:02.400
Ja kirjatud sa na.

55
00:04:05.140 --> 00:04:07.890
Teada ta hiilgusest aus.

56
00:04:07.990 --> 00:04:08.710
Kuid mis?

57
00:04:08.810 --> 00:04:09.940
Vaeva.

58
00:04:10.040 --> 00:04:12.790
Kuninga.

59
00:04:12.890 --> 00:04:15.800
Riigi asjad ju edukad.

60
00:04:17.540 --> 00:04:19.965
Kuid kui olla isa

61
00:04:23.010 --> 00:04:24.020
Ei

62
