63
00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:33.650
Ei.

64
00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:36.350
Kuningas kahjuks ei tea.

65
00:04:39.980 --> 00:04:42.130
Aitab.

66
00:04:42.230 --> 00:04:45.010
Laseraus mõelda.

67
00:04:45.110 --> 00:04:47.560
Küll ma kutsun.

68
00:04:47.660 --> 00:04:50.110
Seal kuningaterve.

69
00:04:53.660 --> 00:04:56.235
Hoolitseb teenri armee.

70
00:04:58.660 --> 00:05:04.390
Isa isa keega sa ei külmeta.
Ei külmeta, ei külmeta,

71
