163
00:13:52.990 --> 00:13:56.790
See sea launas lamaste juures.

164
00:13:56.890 --> 00:14:00.340
Ja Jantsi tööga alustada kohe.

165
00:14:16.020 --> 00:14:19.710
Aiman,
